<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;Malbrough s'en va-t-en guerre&quot; (&quot;Marlborough is going off to war&quot;), also known as &quot;Mort et convoi de l'invincible Malbrough&quot; (&quot;The death and burial of the invincible Marlborough&quot;), is a French folk song.</p></div>
